---
import Layout from '../../../../layouts/Layout.astro';
const d='/equipment/11-02/';
const dr='https://neuro.doriclenses.com/products/laser-diode-module-drivers';
const mod='https://neuro.doriclenses.com/collections/all/products/cldm';
const drPic='https://neuro.doriclenses.com/cdn/shop/files/LDMD_1_480x_128d8773-b31c-4a2c-86e7-9e10260c6ecd.jpg?v=1757428868&width=480';
const modPic='https://neuro.doriclenses.com/cdn/shop/files/CLDM_V02_480.jpg?v=1757428866&width=480';
---
<Layout pageTitle="Doric external housings and independent shapes chart" subtitle="" wide={true}>
<main class="equipment-page di">
 <p><a href="/simulations/equipment/#equipment-11-02">↩ Equipment register · 11-02</a></p>
 <h1>Doric CLDM + LDMD-1 · capped exterior</h1>
 <p>Explore the <strong>unpowered Doric external cases</strong>. The green panel is an unrelated demonstration of reading fixed printed symbols. Both cases are closed, disconnected and nonfunctional; no optics, ports, timing, settings, emissions or biological work are represented.</p>
 <div class="di-grid">
  <section aria-label="Documentary 3D model">
   <div class="di-btn"><button id="di-front" type="button">Reset orbit</button><button id="di-rear" type="button">Rear exterior</button><button id="di-module" type="button">Small housing close-up</button><button id="di-tile" type="button">Shapes close-up</button></div>
   <div id="di-view" role="img" aria-label="Scaled motionless dark driver, capped module and separate green printed-symbol reader"></div><p id="di-status">Loading the two dormant cases…</p>
  </section>
  <section class="di-box">
   <h2>Printed symbol cards</h2>
   <canvas id="di-chart" width="600" height="310" role="img" aria-label="A circle, square and triangle legend with a separate row of fixed printed shapes"></canvas>
   <div class="di-btn"><button id="di-A" type="button">Read A</button><button id="di-B" type="button">Read B</button><button id="di-U" type="button">Read U</button><button id="di-save" type="button">Export JSON</button></div>
   <p id="di-result" role="status"></p>
  </section>
 </div>
 <section id="di-refs">
  <h2>Exterior reference sheet</h2>
  <p>The <a href={drPic}>Doric LDMD-1 top/front photograph</a> establishes the black rectangular case, recessed blank-panel outline and silver cap silhouette. The <a href={modPic}>Doric CLDM exterior photograph</a> establishes the small block and flat mounting plate. Model side seams are estimates; all openings and cabling were omitted. The author’s original exterior below substitutes fixed solid caps for details. No product photos are reproduced.</p>
  <figure><img src={d+'front-reference.webp'} width="595" height="410" alt="Original render of the unpowered black Doric driver, capped module, and unconnected green chart display" loading="lazy"/><figcaption>Original browser render; the driver and capped module are the two dark objects at left. The large green reader is a separate abstract exercise.</figcaption></figure>
  <div class="di-table-scroll" role="region" aria-label="Reference specifications" tabindex="0"><table><thead><tr><th>Object</th><th>Nominal W × D × H</th><th>Source/limit</th></tr></thead><tbody>
   <tr><td>Standalone LDMD-1 outer case</td><td>175 × 105 × 50 mm</td><td><a href={dr}>Vendor LDMD product dimensions</a>, rearranged W/D/H. Not the integrated desktop source with a different enclosure.</td></tr>
   <tr><td>CLDM outer model envelope</td><td>64 × 56 × 22 mm, body 24.6 × 36.8 × 12 mm</td><td><a href={mod}>Vendor CLDM envelope and compact body</a>; no cable geometry shown.</td></tr>
  </tbody></table></div>
 </section>
 <section id="di-proof">
  <h2>Detached chart verification</h2>
  <p>Each known tile is a fixed set of printed shapes. Compare the names to the reference legend; order does not matter. Missing and repeated shapes are reported separately. An absent tile exports null, not a mismatch. JSON contains only symbolic provenance and a fixed illustration ID. The original equipment acceptance for emissions is not represented.</p>
  <div class="di-table-scroll" role="region" aria-label="Verification results" tabindex="0"><table><thead><tr><th>Tile</th><th>Expected</th><th>Actual</th><th>Tolerance</th></tr></thead><tbody>
   <tr><td>A, all three once</td><td>Match despite reordering</td><td>Match</td><td>Exact</td></tr>
   <tr><td>B, triangle twice</td><td>Missing square, duplicate triangle</td><td>Missing square, duplicate triangle</td><td>Exact</td></tr>
   <tr><td>U, no tile</td><td>No result</td><td>JSON null</td><td>Exact</td></tr>
   <tr><td>GLB physical dimensions</td><td>Both exterior dimensions above</td><td>Matched nominal</td><td>0.05 mm</td></tr>
  </tbody></table></div>
  <p><a href={d+'doric-closed.glb'} download>Metric GLB</a> · <a href={d+'build-model.py'} download>Editable Blender source</a> · <a href={d+'example-symbols.json'}>Example JSON</a> · <a href={d+'xr.json'}>Detached shapes XR action metadata</a> (headset unverified).</p>
 </section>
</main>
<script is:inline>window.doricChart=import('/equipment/11-02/symbols.mjs');</script>
<script>import '../../../../lib/equipment/11-02/client.mjs';</script>
</Layout>
<style>
 .di{max-width:81rem;margin:0 auto;padding-inline:1rem}.di-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1.7fr) minmax(16rem,1fr);gap:1.4rem;align-items:start}.di-btn{display:flex;gap:.5rem;flex-wrap:wrap;margin:.55rem 0}.di button{border:1px solid currentColor;border-radius:.2rem;color:inherit;background:transparent;font:inherit;padding:.42rem .61rem;cursor:pointer}.di button[aria-pressed=true]{box-shadow:inset 0 -.2rem currentColor}#di-view{height:clamp(17rem,39vw,40rem);overflow:hidden;border-radius:.25rem;background:#2a3d42;touch-action:none}#di-view :global(canvas){display:block;width:100%;height:100%}#di-chart{display:block;width:100%;height:auto;border-radius:.2rem}.di-box{border:1px solid currentColor;border-radius:.3rem;padding:.95rem}.di table{border-collapse:collapse;width:100%}.di td,.di th{border-bottom:1px solid currentColor;text-align:left;padding:.4rem .53rem}.di section{margin-bottom:1.35rem}.di figure{max-width:36rem;margin:1.1rem 0}.di figure img{max-width:100%;height:auto}@media(max-width:730px){.di-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}}
 .di-table-scroll{max-width:100%;overflow-x:auto}
</style>
